1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 15=

10
00:00:48,840 --> 00:00:49,640
Fangyun?

11
00:00:50,470 --> 00:00:51,470
Yun.

12
00:00:51,470 --> 00:00:52,110
What is it?

13
00:00:52,110 --> 00:00:53,280
Why are you back?

14
00:00:54,030 --> 00:00:55,470
Wasn't this Zhen's idea?

15
00:00:55,470 --> 00:00:56,320
What do you mean?

16
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:58,030
Didn't you tell me to come back?

17
00:01:03,880 --> 00:01:05,180
(Qi Fangyun, Qi Yuan's aunt)
I mourned for Second Young Master Zhou

18
00:01:05,180 --> 00:01:06,230
(Qi Fangyun, Qi Yuan's aunt)
for half a year.

19
00:01:06,480 --> 00:01:07,120
Who knew

20
00:01:07,120 --> 00:01:08,310
that yesterday, Grand Preceptor Zhou

21
00:01:08,310 --> 00:01:10,070
suddenly forced me to take
my own life to die with my husband

22
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:11,480
in exchange for the Zhou family's
chastity plaque.

23
00:01:11,870 --> 00:01:13,950
So I quickly had my dowry maid send word

24
00:01:13,950 --> 00:01:15,230
to ask my parents for help.

25
00:01:15,430 --> 00:01:16,920
She brought back Zhen's letter.

26
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:18,150
The letter said

27
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:19,560
that I should take medicine
and fake my death

28
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,700
and find a chance to escape.

29
00:01:21,230 --> 00:01:22,760
Zhen's plan really worked.

30
00:01:23,070 --> 00:01:24,510
I finally got out.

31
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:25,950
What letter?

32
00:01:25,950 --> 00:01:27,200
I never got any letter.

33
00:01:29,480 --> 00:01:29,920
This...

34
00:01:30,560 --> 00:01:31,150
Aunt.

35
00:01:31,950 --> 00:01:34,040
Where is your dowry maid now?

36
00:01:34,310 --> 00:01:36,310
Lian'er didn't come back?

37
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:38,230
Oh no.

38
00:01:39,750 --> 00:01:41,840
She was probably bought off
by Grand Preceptor Zhou.

39
00:01:42,350 --> 00:01:43,840
Once the chastity plaque is granted,

40
00:01:44,040 --> 00:01:46,840
the Qi family will be charged
with deceiving the Emperor.

41
00:01:50,430 --> 00:01:51,200
Your Lordship,

42
00:01:51,210 --> 00:01:52,920
Grand Preceptor Zhou
has brought people in.

43
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:53,480
What?

44
00:01:57,230 --> 00:01:58,590
Qi Fangyun,

45
00:01:58,590 --> 00:02:00,640
here you are.

46
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:02,790
Marquis Yongping,

47
00:02:03,310 --> 00:02:05,480
you joined forces with Qi Fangyun
to fake her death

48
00:02:05,700 --> 00:02:07,520
and cheat the court
out of a chastity plaque.

49
00:02:07,710 --> 00:02:09,080
The evidence is conclusive.

50
00:02:09,520 --> 00:02:11,000
The Emperor has issued an order.

51
00:02:11,430 --> 00:02:14,960
All the Qi family are
to be taken to prison.

52
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,150
Grand Preceptor Zhou,

53
00:02:16,150 --> 00:02:16,800
what plaque?

54
00:02:16,800 --> 00:02:18,000
I don't know anything about it.

55
00:02:18,800 --> 00:02:19,360
Yuan,

56
00:02:19,520 --> 00:02:20,310
don't be reckless.

57
00:02:20,320 --> 00:02:21,470
Let's speak before the Emperor

58
00:02:21,470 --> 00:02:22,710
and argue our case then.

59
00:02:24,630 --> 00:02:26,310
Are you going to defy the imperial order?

60
00:02:26,560 --> 00:02:27,910
If you anger His Majesty,

61
00:02:28,190 --> 00:02:31,280
you'll drag everyone
in the Qi family down

62
00:02:31,520 --> 00:02:33,800
with you.

63
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:35,680
Qi Yuan.

64
00:02:36,150 --> 00:02:37,240
Let go.

65
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:38,560
Do you want to die?

66
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:40,080
The rest of us don't want to die.

67
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,000
Shut up.

68
00:02:53,080 --> 00:02:54,080
Where is Qi Yuan?

69
00:02:54,080 --> 00:02:55,080
Any word on her?

70
00:02:55,310 --> 00:02:55,870
Your Highness,

71
00:02:55,910 --> 00:02:56,520
what do we do?

72
00:02:56,690 --> 00:02:57,590
His Majesty is furious.

73
00:02:57,680 --> 00:02:58,630
At noon tomorrow,

74
00:02:58,870 --> 00:03:00,470
the Qi family will be beheaded in public.

75
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:02,590
Miss Qi is also wanted.

76
00:03:10,910 --> 00:03:11,960
Noon is almost here.

77
00:03:12,000 --> 00:03:13,310
Take them to the execution ground.

78
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:14,470
Go.

79
00:03:17,630 --> 00:03:18,710
It's all Qi Yuan's fault.

80
00:03:19,030 --> 00:03:20,590
She ruined our whole family.

81
00:03:21,030 --> 00:03:23,120
How did I give birth to such a disaster?

82
00:03:23,360 --> 00:03:24,150
Mother.

83
00:03:24,590 --> 00:03:26,080
We treated her like family,

84
00:03:26,190 --> 00:03:27,310
but she never once put us

85
00:03:27,310 --> 00:03:28,400
in her heart.

86
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:32,240
I don't want to die.

87
00:03:32,240 --> 00:03:32,910
Zhao.

88
00:03:32,910 --> 00:03:35,750
I don't want to die, Mother.

89
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:40,840
Grand Preceptor Zhou.

90
00:03:42,770 --> 00:03:43,400
Grand Preceptor,

91
00:03:43,410 --> 00:03:44,790
something has happened
to the Zhou family.

92
00:03:48,340 --> 00:03:50,140
(Chastity)

93
00:03:50,150 --> 00:03:51,000
Everyone,

94
00:03:51,840 --> 00:03:54,120
the women on the Zhou family's
chastity plaque last night

95
00:03:54,180 --> 00:03:55,280
appeared to me in a dream.

96
00:03:55,960 --> 00:03:56,750
They said

97
00:03:57,030 --> 00:03:59,840
they were framed by generations

98
00:03:59,840 --> 00:04:00,710
of the Zhou family heads.

99
00:04:00,710 --> 00:04:01,960
They were deeply wronged.

100
00:04:02,190 --> 00:04:03,120
Their deaths

101
00:04:03,590 --> 00:04:04,910
were all for this plaque

102
00:04:04,910 --> 00:04:08,840
to preserve the Zhou family's honor.

103
00:04:11,310 --> 00:04:12,310
Nonsense!

104
00:04:12,570 --> 00:04:13,630
I'm talking nonsense?

105
00:04:14,160 --> 00:04:16,610
Grand Preceptor Zhou's younger sister,
Zhou Yingyue.

106
00:04:16,750 --> 00:04:17,070
You...

107
00:04:17,070 --> 00:04:17,890
She had not yet married

108
00:04:17,910 --> 00:04:19,250
when her husband died first.

109
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:21,920
Grand Preceptor Zhou
forced his own younger sister

110
00:04:21,920 --> 00:04:23,160
to marry a memorial tablet.

111
00:04:23,160 --> 00:04:25,920
On the night of the wedding,
his sister hanged herself.

112
00:04:26,260 --> 00:04:27,750
Grand Preceptor Zhou
spread the word everywhere

113
00:04:27,750 --> 00:04:28,800
that his sister

114
00:04:28,800 --> 00:04:31,000
was so steadfast and chaste,

115
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:33,160
and used that
to get this chastity plaque.

116
00:04:33,430 --> 00:04:34,830
The Zhou family became famous,

117
00:04:34,830 --> 00:04:37,000
and he used the chance
to rise in rank and fortune.

118
00:04:37,000 --> 00:04:38,160
But no one knew

119
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,310
that he had strangled

120
00:04:39,510 --> 00:04:41,870
his own sister to death.

121
00:04:42,600 --> 00:04:43,510
Strangled to death?

122
00:04:43,600 --> 00:04:44,800
How outrageous.

123
00:04:44,800 --> 00:04:45,800
How cruel.

124
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:48,270
I can't believe
Grand Preceptor Zhou would do that.

125
00:04:48,290 --> 00:04:49,480
That's a baseless accusation.

126
00:04:50,430 --> 00:04:52,750
How dare you slander
an imperial official?

127
00:04:52,750 --> 00:04:55,010
If your sister truly died
in self-sacrifice for her husband,

128
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:57,730
why would the memorial tablet
worshipped by the Zhou family

129
00:04:57,740 --> 00:04:59,320
have a soul-suppressing formation
laid into it,

130
00:04:59,320 --> 00:05:00,200
with your sister's

131
00:05:00,210 --> 00:05:02,280
and the other women's birth dates

132
00:05:02,280 --> 00:05:03,440
carved into it?

133
00:05:04,480 --> 00:05:05,360
Everyone, look.

134
00:05:05,400 --> 00:05:07,240
These are the birth dates
of the women suppressed by the Zhou family

135
00:05:07,240 --> 00:05:09,120
at the Guanyin Temple
in the west of the city.

136
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:11,560
Zhou Yingyue.

137
00:05:11,560 --> 00:05:16,680
Hour of Jichou, Day of Xinyou,
Month of Gengwu, Year of Jimao.

138
00:05:16,950 --> 00:05:18,190
Zhou Jingshu,

139
00:05:18,310 --> 00:05:19,310
Qin of Zhou family,

140
00:05:19,310 --> 00:05:20,270
Lin of Zhou family.

141
00:05:20,270 --> 00:05:22,480
(Zhou Yingyue, Zhou Jingshu)
These names and birth dates

142
00:05:22,680 --> 00:05:23,680
match

143
00:05:23,680 --> 00:05:24,870
those on the plaque.

144
00:05:28,870 --> 00:05:31,920
The names and birth dates
on the chastity plaque

145
00:05:32,240 --> 00:05:34,120
are there for everyone to see.

146
00:05:34,600 --> 00:05:35,560
It must be you

147
00:05:35,750 --> 00:05:37,830
who copied the words from the plaque

148
00:05:37,830 --> 00:05:38,950
onto the yellow paper

149
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:40,600
to frame the Zhou family.

150
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:41,800
Is that not so?

151
00:05:42,720 --> 00:05:44,160
If she copied it,

152
00:05:44,160 --> 00:05:45,900
then Grand Preceptor Zhou
would be wrongly accused.

153
00:05:47,950 --> 00:05:49,120
You say that's fake?

154
00:05:52,310 --> 00:05:53,590
What about your daughter-in-law,

155
00:05:54,510 --> 00:05:55,720
Qi Fangyun?

156
00:06:03,600 --> 00:06:05,360
The Zhou family's eldest son, Zhou Ping,

157
00:06:05,360 --> 00:06:06,920
was a regular at Yueying Pleasure House.

158
00:06:06,920 --> 00:06:08,270
He died of the pox.

159
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,000
The pox?

160
00:06:10,560 --> 00:06:11,600
Grand Preceptor Zhou,

161
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:13,160
your son was a lecher.

162
00:06:13,160 --> 00:06:14,160
He got what he deserved.

163
00:06:14,720 --> 00:06:16,600
And yet you forced his wife

164
00:06:16,600 --> 00:06:17,920
to die in chastity for him.

165
00:06:18,240 --> 00:06:19,120
In this world,

166
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,610
what kind of heartless logic is that?

167
00:06:20,750 --> 00:06:22,000
Exactly. How can that be?

168
00:06:22,000 --> 00:06:22,800
That's right.

169
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:24,390
There's no such thing.

170
00:06:25,270 --> 00:06:26,240
Prince Jing,

171
00:06:26,870 --> 00:06:28,240
you can't just believe that woman.

172
00:06:28,240 --> 00:06:31,480
That's only her one-sided story.

173
00:06:32,300 --> 00:06:33,800
This was dug up from your son's grave.

174
00:06:33,800 --> 00:06:35,270
It's his personal belongings.

175
00:06:36,480 --> 00:06:38,160
If he didn't die of the pox,

176
00:06:38,800 --> 00:06:40,680
you can pick this up

177
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:41,920
and show everyone.

178
00:06:43,070 --> 00:06:46,040
- Pick it up.
- Go on, pick it up.

179
00:06:46,040 --> 00:06:47,560
Did everyone hear that?

180
00:06:48,120 --> 00:06:50,160
His son was exactly that kind of man.

181
00:06:50,200 --> 00:06:51,310
And yet he still wants to force

182
00:06:51,310 --> 00:06:52,730
his innocent daughter-in-law to die.

183
00:06:52,950 --> 00:06:54,360
He's using our women's lives

184
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:56,600
to prop up the Zhou family's reputation.

185
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,950
- Exactly.
- Exactly.

186
00:06:57,950 --> 00:06:59,040
There's no such thing.

187
00:06:59,040 --> 00:07:00,560
Shameless scoundrel.

188
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,310
So shameless.

189
00:07:01,310 --> 00:07:02,830
What's carved on that chastity plaque

190
00:07:03,430 --> 00:07:04,920
is not some great virtue

191
00:07:05,310 --> 00:07:07,070
but a living, breathing life.

192
00:07:08,360 --> 00:07:09,630
They are daughters,

193
00:07:09,630 --> 00:07:10,830
sisters,

194
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:12,600
and mothers.

195
00:07:13,390 --> 00:07:15,560
They were bound
by these heartless old rules

196
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:18,430
and forced by the cold-blooded Zhou family.

197
00:07:19,160 --> 00:07:20,870
They gave their lives,

198
00:07:20,870 --> 00:07:23,600
only to win the Zhou family
a hollow reputation.

199
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,630
Today,

200
00:07:24,800 --> 00:07:26,560
I want to ask for them

201
00:07:26,800 --> 00:07:29,430
and for all women.

202
00:07:29,430 --> 00:07:31,430
Why must a woman's name

203
00:07:31,430 --> 00:07:33,120
only be written on a stone tablet?

204
00:07:33,430 --> 00:07:34,560
Why should men

205
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:37,360
rise to power and enter officialdom

206
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,600
by stepping on them?

207
00:07:38,600 --> 00:07:39,720
Why?

208
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:41,240
Exactly. Why?

209
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:42,680
Why?

210
00:07:42,680 --> 00:07:43,360
Why is that?

211
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:44,800
- Why?
- Why?

212
00:07:45,240 --> 00:07:46,120
Smash it.

213
00:07:47,040 --> 00:07:50,190
- Smash it.
- Smash it.

214
00:07:50,360 --> 00:07:51,240
Don't smash it.

215
00:07:51,630 --> 00:07:56,750
- Smash it.
- Smash it.

216
00:07:56,750 --> 00:07:57,740
(Die in chastity after their husband dies.
A model of virtue.)

217
00:08:15,680 --> 00:08:18,190
By imperial decree,

218
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,560
the Zhou family forced
the death of their own kin.

219
00:08:20,570 --> 00:08:21,950
Their title is revoked,
and they are punished.

220
00:08:22,240 --> 00:08:22,680
Also,

221
00:08:22,950 --> 00:08:24,000
from this day on,

222
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:26,270
anyone who trades chastity
for rank or salary

223
00:08:26,600 --> 00:08:28,190
is forever forbidden by law.

224
00:08:30,480 --> 00:08:31,360
Grand Preceptor Zhou

225
00:08:31,680 --> 00:08:33,960
was my only support in court.

226
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:35,440
And you still couldn't catch Qi Yuan?

227
00:08:35,440 --> 00:08:36,750
What good are you?

228
00:08:37,000 --> 00:08:38,480
I almost had Qi Yuan.

229
00:08:38,480 --> 00:08:39,440
Almost?

230
00:08:39,670 --> 00:08:40,790
Almost?

231
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:42,870
What's the use of saying that now?

232
00:08:42,870 --> 00:08:43,600
I don't even have

233
00:08:43,600 --> 00:08:45,440
a single useful man left under me.

234
00:08:45,440 --> 00:08:47,390
Don't we still have Prince Cheng?

235
00:08:47,390 --> 00:08:49,080
What use is a prince

236
00:08:49,390 --> 00:08:50,480
with no real power?

237
00:08:54,720 --> 00:08:55,910
You're right.

238
00:08:56,390 --> 00:08:58,000
Frequent guests at Yueying Pleasure House

239
00:08:59,120 --> 00:09:01,790
weren't only those men
from the Court of Judicial Review.

240
00:09:07,670 --> 00:09:08,240
Your Highness,

241
00:09:08,250 --> 00:09:10,290
Prince Cheng is nothing
but a wolf in fine clothes.

242
00:09:10,300 --> 00:09:12,550
He's tortured more
than ten princess consorts to death.

243
00:09:12,870 --> 00:09:13,440
And you think

244
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:13,790
No.

245
00:09:14,240 --> 00:09:15,360
where did all his wives

246
00:09:16,480 --> 00:09:17,910
come from?

247
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:21,030
No.

248
00:09:21,030 --> 00:09:21,910
Take her away.

249
00:09:22,080 --> 00:09:22,670
No.

250
00:09:22,670 --> 00:09:23,750
Your Highness, no!

251
00:09:24,150 --> 00:09:24,910
Go.

252
00:09:24,910 --> 00:09:25,930
- Your Highness, no!
- Go.

253
00:09:26,030 --> 00:09:26,910
Your Highness!

254
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,080
Qi Yuan.

255
00:09:30,510 --> 00:09:32,510
I meant to spare your life.

256
00:09:33,270 --> 00:09:34,670
But you...

257
00:09:36,980 --> 00:09:38,100
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

258
00:09:38,120 --> 00:09:39,970
Thank you for helping me today,
Your Highness.

259
00:09:40,150 --> 00:09:42,240
But our cooperation is over.

260
00:09:42,600 --> 00:09:43,670
Prince Qi is still here.

261
00:09:44,510 --> 00:09:45,550
How can it be over?

262
00:09:47,510 --> 00:09:48,910
Then let's each go our own way.

263
00:09:52,320 --> 00:09:53,550
What if I refuse?

264
00:10:00,150 --> 00:10:01,630
If you know something is wrong,

265
00:10:02,550 --> 00:10:03,630
you should hold your horse.

266
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:13,870
Xiao Yunting,

267
00:10:14,150 --> 00:10:15,200
listen.

268
00:10:16,120 --> 00:10:17,240
You still owe me

269
00:10:17,630 --> 00:10:19,150
from our previous life.

270
00:10:21,550 --> 00:10:23,550
(What did I owe her in my last life?)

271
00:10:24,790 --> 00:10:25,440
(Could it be)

272
00:10:26,630 --> 00:10:28,150
(that I wronged her?)

273
00:10:42,580 --> 00:10:47,220
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

274
00:10:47,600 --> 00:10:51,380
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

275
00:10:51,890 --> 00:10:57,350
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

276
00:10:57,570 --> 00:11:01,730
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

277
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:06,800
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

278
00:11:07,600 --> 00:11:14,500
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
